===Etymology===
From {{m|non|hvar||where}}, {{m|non|hvat||what}} + {{m|non|-an|tr=ablative adverb}}. Compare {{m|non|þaðan}}, {{m|non|héðan}}.

===Adverb===
{{non-adv|-}}

# [[whence]], [[wherefrom]], [[from]] [[where]]
#: {{ux|non|'''hvaðan''' kømr þú?|'''whence''' do you come?}}

